  <TITLE>Drop-Seq analysis of ERCC spike in capture</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>A bead supsension and a solution of ERCC spike-ins at a concentration of ~100,000 molecules per droplet was used in Drop-Seq, a novel technology for high-throughput single cell mRNAseq Overall design: An estimated 84 beads were selected for amplification.</DESCRIPTION>
